{"type": "file", "p": "280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2F280%20Zzzap%20%2B%20Dodgem%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "1.94 KB", "size_bytes": 1986}], "meta": {"path": "./280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "280 Zzzap+dodgem", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 1.94 KB\n\nThe title was named after the US advertising campaign for the Datsun 280Z. Players can drive up to 200 miles per hour (320 km/h) while navigating a tricky road course at night. Players must watch out for treacherous turns, nasty competitors, and the ever-present time limit.\nIt is one of the earliest games, if not the earliest, with authorized branding.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/280 Zzzap + Dodgem (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19780101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Carreras, Conducción", "md5": "cfa3a6214c2c05f018c5dfe505106e32", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 1986, "size": "1.94 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FAmazing%20Maze%20%2B%20Tic-Tac-Toe%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "1.93 KB", "size_bytes": 1976}], "meta": {"path": "./Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "Amazing Maze+tic Tac Toe", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 1.93 KB\n\nTwo mind-boggling challenges! Amazing Maze is a race through a maze between you and the computer or another player. The maze is truly amazing because it changes every time you play. Select easy ones or hard ones to match any skill level. Tic-Tac-Toe is the traditional game with a diabolical twist. You get to play against the computer! 1 or 2 players.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Amazing Maze + Tic-Tac-Toe (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19780101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Compilación", "players": "1-2", "md5": "c980f4b445b62f02cb464822c8a21fc6", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 1976, "size": "1.93 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally).zip", "n": "Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FArtillery%20Duel%20%281982%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "3.71 KB", "size_bytes": 3799}], "meta": {"path": "./Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally).zip", "name": "Artillery Duel", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.71 KB\n\nIn this two player game each player controls an artillery gun set in a mountain landscape with the goal of destroying the other player. Players take turns firing at each other; on each turn you have a limited amount of time in which the barrel angle and powder level can be set in order to control the direction and distance of the shot. When deciding on your shot, you will need to take the current conditions into account, which includes wind speed/direction and any mountains that may get in your way. Successfully destroying your opponents gun will earn you a point, and the first player to reach the set number of points wins the game. There are multiple skill levels available which set the amount of time you have to make a shot.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Artillery Duel (1982)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19820101T000000", "developer": "Perkins Engineering", "publisher": "Astrocade", "genre": "Estrategia", "players": "1-4", "md5": "b51af990193e281c07a02da1fde24a64", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3799, "size": "3.71 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b].zip", "n": "Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b]", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FAstro%20Battle%20%281981%29%28Astrovision%29%5Bb%5D.zip", "size": "2.67 KB", "size_bytes": 2734}], "meta": {"path": "./Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b].zip", "name": "Astro Battle", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 2.67 KB\n\nAstro Battle 2009 (or sometimes just Astro Battle) is a Space Invaders clone published by Bally Manufacturing in 1978 for the Bally Astrocade arcade system. The aim is to defeat waves of aliens with a laser cannon and earn as many points as possible.[citation needed] Unlike Space Invaders, Astro Battle 2009 is in color", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b]-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b]-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b]-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b]-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b]-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Astro Battle (1981)(Astrovision)[b]-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19810101T000000", "developer": "Bally Manufacturing", "publisher": "Astrocade", "genre": "Disparos / Tipo Space Invaders", "players": "1", "md5": "208fa0312676b8ccab3811e917320b21", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 2734, "size": "2.67 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b].zip", "n": "Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b]", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FBally%20Pinball%20%281981%29%28Bally%29%5Bb%5D.zip", "size": "3.49 KB", "size_bytes": 3573}], "meta": {"path": "./Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b].zip", "name": "Bally Pin", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.49 KB\n\nBally Pin is a pinball game featuring two different tables. The game is played with two joysticks, with one controlling the two left flippers and the other controlling the two to the right. The game can be played by up to four players who take turns until all player have used up all of their five balls. The aim is simply to get the highest score. The two tables are similar but with slightly different layouts and both feature six bumpers (lit or unlit), drop targets, upper kicker targets and a spinner. The ball is meant to react as a real ball would when struck by a flipper with the speed and angle of it being affected by where on the flipper it is hit.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b]-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b]-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b]-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b]-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b]-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Bally Pinball (1981)(Bally)[b]-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19810101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Pinball", "players": "1-4", "md5": "bf85db93f1b101f9c1ea2b75e575cce3", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3573, "size": "3.49 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FBlackjack%20%2B%20Poker%20%2B%20Acey-Duecy%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "3.60 KB", "size_bytes": 3686}], "meta": {"path": "./Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "Blackjack+poker+acey-deucy", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.60 KB\n\nBlackjack/Poker/Acey-Deucey is a game compilation, that features 3 card games. \nBlackjack and Acey-Deucey can be played 1 or more players, while Poker doesn't feature single-player.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Blackjack + Poker + Acey-Duecy (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19780101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Casino / Cartas", "players": "1-4", "md5": "166235e5e8c4deca38e902e23e8c6acd", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3686, "size": "3.60 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica).zip", "n": "Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FBlast%20Droids%20%2819xx%29%28Esoterica%29.zip", "size": "2.79 KB", "size_bytes": 2856}], "meta": {"path": "./Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica).zip", "name": "Blast Droids", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 2.79 KB\n\nBlast Droids tiene a los jugadores pilotando una nave alrededor de una arena horizontal, disparando a naves alienígenas mientras tienen cuidado de evitar los disparos que rebotan en las paredes.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Blast Droids (19xx)(Esoterica)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19830101T000000", "publisher": "Esoterica", "genre": "Shoot'em Up", "md5": "1087f7ee9e016c84234b99fe9cffe0a3", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 2856, "size": "2.79 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FClowns%20%2B%20Brickyard%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "3.35 KB", "size_bytes": 3430}], "meta": {"path": "./Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "Brickyard+clowns", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.35 KB\n\nThis cartridge consists of two games: Brickyard and Clowns. Both games can be played by one to four players.\nIn Clowns you get points for popping balloons at the top of the screen. To reach them, you have to move a seesaw under a jumping clown. This will launch away the clown already standing on the seesaw, hopefully towards the balloons. \nBrickyard is a clone of Breakout. It is almost identical to the original game but differs in that the ball moves in a trajectory and not in a straight path. The game can be played in four different difficulties that alters the speed of the ball as well as the size of the paddle.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Clowns + Brickyard (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19790101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "players": "1-4", "md5": "9fb208a72d7bb2800a990db20186a409", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3430, "size": "3.35 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision).zip", "n": "Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FCosmic%20Raider%20%2819xx%29%28Astrovision%29.zip", "size": "6.13 KB", "size_bytes": 6277}], "meta": {"path": "./Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision).zip", "name": "Cosmic Raiders", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 6.13 KB\n\nCosmic Raiders es un shoot 'em up de desplazamiento lateral similar a Defender. Al igual que en ese juego, la nave espacial del jugador puede moverse tanto a la izquierda como a la derecha y también hay un radar que muestra las ubicaciones de los enemigos. El juego se desarrolla en el sector alienígena Larkin y el objetivo del jugador es defender un planeta bajo ataque mientras también recolecta fuentes de energía de una raza alienígena malvada llamada los Larkins. En cada nivel se lanzan cuatro bombas junto con varios cazas para asegurar que las bombas lleguen a la superficie del planeta. El objetivo del juego es simplemente eliminar a todos los enemigos y obtener la puntuación más alta posible. Por cada dos bombas destruidas, aparecerá una estrella de energía que el jugador puede recolectar. Al recogerla, la nave del jugador se energiza con un escudo de energía invencible. Una vez que todos los enemigos han sido eliminados de un nivel, el juego pasa al siguiente.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision)-image.jpg", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Cosmic Raider (19xx)(Astrovision)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19821101T000000", "developer": "Action Graphics", "publisher": "Astrocade", "genre": "Shoot'em Up", "players": "1-4", "md5": "d1083ae8aec40250d9643b525c69531c", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 6277, "size": "6.13 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FDogpatch%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "1.69 KB", "size_bytes": 1730}], "meta": {"path": "./Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "Dog Patch", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 1.69 KB\n\n¡Un auténtico tiro al plato casero! El objetivo gira en el aire mientras levantas tu escopeta y disparas. Un buen tiro mantiene el objetivo rebotando entre los jugadores. ¡Un explosivo acto de malabarismo con calibre 12 acumula una gran puntuación! Lanza el objetivo más allá de tu oponente para ganar puntos. Juega partidas largas o cortas y varía el número de objetivos. 1 o 2 jugadores.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Dogpatch (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19780101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Shoot'em Up", "players": "1-2", "md5": "9db9fab29161142edce3f882a9da3ec0", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 1730, "size": "1.69 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Football (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "Football (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FFootball%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "3.41 KB", "size_bytes": 3491}], "meta": {"path": "./Football (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "Football", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.41 KB\n\nCompleta un pase por el centro para lograr un first down. El juego ofrece ocho opciones de jugadas ofensivas, incluyendo carreras por los extremos, pases pantalla, lanzamientos largos, pases cortos o largos por el centro y algunas jugadas estratégicas con engaños.\nLos jugadores ofensivos pueden controlar directamente a los esquineros, mientras que la computadora maneja el resto del equipo. Permite hasta 4 jugadores.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Football (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Football (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Football (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Football (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Football (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Football (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19780101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Deportes", "md5": "42dd9e2dda47c9b89afcc66c6ecdf9b0", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3491, "size": "3.41 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p].zip", "n": "Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p]", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FGalaxian%20%281981%29%28Astrovision%29%5Bp%5D.zip", "size": "3.32 KB", "size_bytes": 3399}], "meta": {"path": "./Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p].zip", "name": "Galaxian", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.32 KB\n\nAlien ships come at your missile launcher from every direction. They peel off from their formation singly or in groups of twos or threes. The more aliens you destroy, The more of their reinforcements attack. Each ship is piloted by a highly skilled captain capable of maneuvering with incredible agility. Realistic sounds add to the intensity! Up to 4 players.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p]-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p]-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p]-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p]-video.mp4", "fanart": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p]-fanart.jpg", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Galaxian (1981)(Astrovision)[p]-boxback.png", "releasedate": "19810101T000000", "developer": "Astrovision", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Disparos / Tipo Space Invaders", "players": "1-2", "md5": "f16e4ad1b9144b463562ed185bc777d4", "family": "Galaxian", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3399, "size": "3.32 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FGrand%20Prix%20%2B%20Demolition%20Derby%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "3.22 KB", "size_bytes": 3297}], "meta": {"path": "./Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "Grand Prix + Demolition Derby", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.22 KB\n\nGrand Prix is a formula racing game played from a top down perspective. There are three different tracks that are all one screen in size. The controls simply involve accelerating and steering left and right with the aim of reaching the finish line first. The number of laps (1-99) and the difficulty level (pro or beginner) can be selected before a race. Pro differs in the speed of the cars.\nDemolition Derby is similar to Grand Prix but here the objective is to ram into the other cars until only one remains in the arena. Each car has a number of points (which is chosen by the players) and for each hit one point is lost. When a car reaches zero points it loses and cannot move any further.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Grand Prix + Demolition Derby (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19810101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Carreras, Conducción", "md5": "382d4ee5da98608dfed55282fda7d2c1", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3297, "size": "3.22 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision).zip", "n": "Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FIncredible%20Wizard%2C%20The%20%281981%29%28Astrovision%29.zip", "size": "6.59 KB", "size_bytes": 6748}], "meta": {"path": "./Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision).zip", "name": "The Incredible Wizard", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 6.59 KB\n\nWizard of Wor is an arcade shooter played from a top-down point of view.\nThe Bally Astrocade release of the game was titled The Incredible Wizard. It had the game ref number 2017 as a suffix.\nThe player controls a warrior who is trapped in a dungeon. The goal is to earn as many points as possible by shooting the numerous enemy creatures which wander about the maze like corridors. The creatures wander about at various speeds, may shoot darts at the player, and some even have the ability to disappear temporarily. At the bottom of the screen the player has a radar which can be used to locate creatures that are invisible.\nWhen the the player completes a maze, a Worluk sometimes appears. This creature moves rapidly and will only be on the screen momentarily. If the player destroys the creature before it escapes, the next dungeon will become a double score dungeon and all creatures will be worth twice as many points. Occasionally the Wizard of Wor himself may appear! He moves quickly and can teleport around the maze. If they destroy him, the player will earn a large amount of points.\nThe game may be played by one player or two players simultaneously.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Incredible Wizard, The (1981)(Astrovision)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19820101T000000", "publisher": "Astrocade", "md5": "39fa60fe4441ca5b57de8ed2865d2f0f", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 6748, "size": "6.59 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Muncher (19xx)(Esoterica).zip", "n": "Muncher (19xx)(Esoterica)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FMuncher%20%2819xx%29%28Esoterica%29.zip", "size": "5.71 KB", "size_bytes": 5847}], "meta": {"path": "./Muncher (19xx)(Esoterica).zip", "name": "Muncher", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 5.71 KB\n\nYou are captive in a maze of creepy ghosts. It's a spooky situation, and you can do one of two things: munch or be munched. Score as many points as possible, gobbling up everything in your path - including the ghosts with an appetite for YOU! Do your best to save your soul.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Muncher (19xx)(Esoterica)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Muncher (19xx)(Esoterica)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Muncher (19xx)(Esoterica)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Muncher (19xx)(Esoterica)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Muncher (19xx)(Esoterica)-boxback.png", "releasedate": "19830101T000000", "developer": "Esoterica", "publisher": "Bally", "players": "1-2", "md5": "bfd5a241507a8d996d86986edad1f963", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 5847, "size": "5.71 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FPanzer%20Attack%20%2B%20Red%20Baron%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "3.17 KB", "size_bytes": 3246}], "meta": {"path": "./Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "Red Baron + Panzer Attack", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.17 KB\n\nRed Baron is a dogfighting game played from a side perspective on a single screen. Both planes start rolling on the ground and have to lift before crashing into a barn. Once in the air the planes can be moved in all directions and it's also possible to alter the speed. The aim is simply to get as many kills as possible before the time runs out. The time limit is chosen by the players before starting out.\nPanzer Attack is a tank game viewed from a top-down perspective. All player share the same single screen which has a few blockades for protections. The tanks can move in all directions and the aim of the game is simply to score points by destroying the other tanks. A battle ends when just one tank remains standing and the player with the highest score when all battle have been played wins. The number of battles can be chosen before starting out from 1-99.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Panzer Attack + Red Baron (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19780101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Compilación", "md5": "2c09f0c29de236374be8bf0d233bcf65", "family": "Red Baron", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3246, "size": "3.17 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b].zip", "n": "Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b]", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FSeawolf%20%2B%20Missile%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29%5Bb%5D.zip", "size": "2.00 KB", "size_bytes": 2048}], "meta": {"path": "./Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b].zip", "name": "Seawolf + Missile", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 2.00 KB\n\n¡Seawolf! Desde las profundidades del mar, disparas tus torpedos a los petroleros, acorazados y otros objetivos. Tu misión es hundir más barcos enemigos que cualquier otro submarino de la manada de lobos. Es una carrera contra el tiempo y otros submarinos de tu propia armada. ¡Misil! ¡Lanza misiles guiados contra aviones de carga, bombarderos y cazas! Dos juegos completos. ¡Horas de diversión! 1 o 2 jugadores.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b]-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b]-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b]-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b]-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b]-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Seawolf + Missile (19xx)(Bally)[b]-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19770101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Shoot'em Up", "md5": "f4b0b549a17776d8befb030b15363c00", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 2048, "size": "2.00 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally).zip", "n": "Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally)", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FSpace%20Fortress%20%2819xx%29%28Bally%29.zip", "size": "3.33 KB", "size_bytes": 3409}], "meta": {"path": "./Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally).zip", "name": "Space Fortress", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 3.33 KB\n\nLanzado en las Arcades como Space Zap y para el Bally Astrocade como Space Fortress.nnnnEste es un shoot 'em up de pantalla fija donde el jugador controla una base láser estacionaria que se encuentra en el medio de la pantalla. Naves espaciales alienígenas aparecerán desde los cuatro lados de la pantalla y lanzarán minas espaciales hacia la base láser. La tarea del jugador es simplemente derribarlas antes de que alcancen y destruyan la base láser.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally)-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally)-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally)-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally)-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally)-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Space Fortress (19xx)(Bally)-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19810101T000000", "publisher": "Astrocade", "genre": "Shoot'em Up", "md5": "94a5dd15dcf0f032f6d969e0020d9584", "lang": "en"}, "size_bytes": 3409, "size": "3.33 KB"}
{"type": "file", "p": "Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b].zip", "n": "Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b]", "ext": ".zip", "parent": "", "urls": [{"u": "https://archive.org/download/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23/Bally_Professional_Arcade_and_Astrocade_TOSEC_2012_04_23.zip/Bally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%5BTOSEC%5D%2FBally%20Professional%20Arcade%20%26%20Astrocade%20-%20Games%20%28TOSEC-v2009-10-13_CM%29%2FStar%20Battle%20%2819xx%29%28Astrovision%29%5Bb%5D.zip", "size": "1.95 KB", "size_bytes": 1996}], "meta": {"path": "./Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b].zip", "name": "Star Battle", "desc": "⬇ Tamaño de descarga: 1.95 KB\n\nStar Battle es un juego de disparos espacial basado en la secuencia de la carrera de trincheras de la película original de Star Wars. El juego es para uno o dos jugadores e involucra una batalla entre un X-Wing y un Tie Fighter, aunque como no tiene licencia, no se llaman así. El X-Wing es controlado por el jugador uno, mientras que el Tie Fighter es controlado por el jugador dos o la computadora. Antes de comenzar, se ingresa una puntuación máxima (1-999) y el jugador que la alcance primero gana el juego. Un solo golpe es suficiente para derribar la nave enemiga y vale un punto.", "image": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b]-image.png", "thumbnail": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b]-thumb.png", "marquee": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b]-marquee.png", "video": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/videos/Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b]-video.mp4", "boxback": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/images/Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b]-boxback.png", "manual": "Z:/Digistorage/Arley4dCloudMedia/astrocade/manuals/Star Battle (19xx)(Astrovision)[b]-manual.pdf", "releasedate": "19810101T000000", "publisher": "Bally", "genre": "Shoot'em Up",